WEBVTT

00:00:01.240 --> 00:00:04.240
The Remco Movieland Driving Theater is straight ahead!

00:00:04.240 --> 00:00:06.040
Here it is now, Betty!

00:00:06.040 --> 00:00:07.040
Today's double feature:

00:00:07.040 --> 00:00:09.890
Have Gun Will Travel and Heckle and Jekyll

00:00:09.890 --> 00:00:12.070
It looks terrific, Jimmy!

00:00:12.070 --> 00:00:13.980
Drive right in the park!

00:00:13.980 --> 00:00:16.150
Let me show you how it works!

00:00:16.150 --> 00:00:18.290
Switch on the projector, turn the fill knob,

00:00:18.290 --> 00:00:21.500
and you'll see six exciting still features!

00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:23.500
Have Gun Will Travel and Heckle and Jekyll!

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:25.500
Captain Kangaroo and Dinky Duck!

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:28.500
Mighty Mouse and Farmer Alfalfa!

00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:30.000
Golly, what's clear?

00:00:30.540 --> 00:00:34.550
This Remco Movieland Drive-In Theater has everything!

00:00:34.550 --> 00:00:36.440
Six complete features:

00:00:36.440 --> 00:00:38.390
its own giant screen,

00:00:38.390 --> 00:00:39.390
projection booth,

00:00:39.390 --> 00:00:40.390
marquee that changes,

00:00:40.390 --> 00:00:41.390
ticket window,

00:00:41.390 --> 00:00:43.390
and six beautiful cars.

00:00:43.390 --> 00:00:45.530
Be the first in your neighborhood

00:00:45.530 --> 00:00:49.530
to own and operate a Remco Movieland Drive-In Theater.

00:00:49.530 --> 00:00:52.450
Only $5.98 at your favorite toy store.

00:00:52.450 --> 00:00:56.380
Remember, every boy wants a Remco toy.

00:00:56.380 --> 00:00:57.810
And so do girls.
